    "description": "Full-length fantasy movies about dragons, giants, lost kingdoms and the people brave enough to love the monsters. 🐉\n\nI make every film on this channel myself, with AI as my camera. Each one starts with an original story and characters I design from scratch. Then I build the rest, scene by scene: the world, the creatures, the editing, the sound and the music. The tools are new, but the job is the oldest one in cinema: make you care about someone, then put them in danger.\n\nThese are real movies, not clips or loops. They run from twenty minutes to an hour, with a beginning, a middle and an ending that pays off. Stolen eggs, lost princesses, kingdoms in flames, and monsters that turn out to be family.\n\nNo studio behind it, just a storyteller, a desktop computer and a lot of late nights. Pick a film, settle in, and tell me in the comments what you'd like to see next.\n\n#FantasyMovie #FullMovie #DragonMovie #AIFilm #FantasyMovieKingdom\n",
